@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy & Compliance - Kalash Amulya";
    Layout = "_Layout";
}

<div class="content-container" style="padding: 60px 24px 90px; max-width: 960px;">
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
        <span class="roopak-eyebrow">CUSTOMER DATA PROTECTION &amp; PURITY GUARANTEE</span>
        <h1 class="roopak-section-title">Privacy Policy &amp; <em>Terms of Trust</em></h1>
        <p class="section-subtext">Last updated: October 2026 &bull; Compliant with Information Technology Act, 2000 and FSSAI Guidelines.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="seo-card-wrap" style="padding: 36px 40px; margin-top: 24px;">
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--forest); margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Kalash Amulya Naturals Pvt. Ltd. collects information that you provide directly when registering an account, placing simulated demo orders, requesting bulk corporate gifting quotes, or subscribing to our harvest dispatch newsletter. This includes your name, delivery address in Kanpur or elsewhere in India, telephone number, and email address.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--forest); margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Use of Your Personal Information</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            We use your data solely to fulfill and track your pantry orders, provide Kanpur local same-day delivery updates, verify FSSAI compliance audits, and send optional seasonal crop harvest updates. We strictly do not sell, rent, or trade customer contact information to third-party advertisers.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--forest); margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Secure Cookie Authentication</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Our customer portal utilizes secure, HTTP-only authentication cookies (<code>KalashAmulya_Auth</code>) to maintain your login session across your visits. You can sign out at any time by selecting "Sign Out" in your profile dashboard.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--forest); margin-bottom: 12px;">4. FSSAI Food Grade Compliance</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            All food packaging, storage, and handling protocols conform to Central FSSAI License No. 12721055000341 and ISO 22000 standards. Our facility at 173-B, Dada Nagar Industrial Area, Kanpur undergoes regular micro-biological testing and moisture verification.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--forest); margin-bottom: 12px;">5. Contacting Our Data &amp; Compliance Officer</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">
            For privacy inquiries or account deletion requests, write to our grievance officer at <strong>care@kalashamulya.com</strong> or call <strong>+91 512 2295000</strong>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
